# Type scale

Fixed sizes — source of truth in `css/main.css` (`:root`) and `DESIGN.md`:

- **Title:** 64px (`--text-title-size` / `--case-title-size`) — major section headings, intro/page titles
- **Subheading / secondary:** 32px weight 500 (`--text-secondary-size` / `--case-secondary-size`) — section subtitles (Key Takeaways!, What's Next, research/process subheads, feature-row titles, Key Insights / Core Design, etc.)
- **Tertiary / body:** 16px (`--text-tertiary-size` / `--case-tertiary-size`)

Use these roles for case-study and portfolio text. Do not invent alternate heading sizes.
